OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fsoon dying out across Shetland,
OL,7,Fotherwise a dry evening. Thickening
OL,8,Fcloud will bring some light and patchy
OL,9,Frain from the southwest during the
OL,10,Fearly hours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FPersistent rain will spread
OL,13,Feast for a time in the morning. Drier
OL,14,Fand brighter weather extending from
OL,15,Fthe west in the afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,18,Fwith bright spells on Wednesday. Rain
OL,19,Fspreading northeast Thursday. Windy
OL,20,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain
OL,21,Fon Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
